  lines:
  - text: Dr. Stan! I'm so glad to see you.
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: Thank you for accepting my invitation and coming to Punkofeller University.
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: Your help means a great deal to us.
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: As I mentioned in my letter, Punkofeller University has been facing...
      a number of troubling issues lately.
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
